{"chunk_id": "9894d311e578", "text": "Vishwamitra unleashes a devastating barrage of divine weapons upon the hermitage of the sage Vasishtha, driving sages, animals, and disciples into terrified flight. Enraged by the destruction, Vasishtha confronts the warrior-king and challenges him to use every celestial weapon he possesses. Vishwamitra releases a vast arsenal granted by the gods, yet Vasishtha calmly neutralizes each one with the spiritual power embodied in his Brahma staff. In desperation Vishwamitra invokes the terrible Brahman\u2011astra, shaking the three worlds with fear, but even this supreme weapon is subdued by Vasishtha\u2019s mastery of Brahman\u2011vidya. Witnessing the triumph of spiritual ascetic power over martial force, Vishwamitra realizes the superiority of spiritual attainment and resolves to abandon his warrior pride and pursue the path of penance to become a Brahmin sage.\nVasishtha neutralizes all of Vishwamitra\u2019s divine weapons with his Brahma-staff and spiritual power, prompting Vishwamitra to renounce warrior pride and pursue asceticism.\nThemes: spiritual power vs martial power, ascetic supremacy, humbling of pride, divine weapons, turn toward penance", "vector": [-0.004994591698050499, -0.021808136254549026, 2.4381037292187102e-05, 0.009867198765277863, -0.004767564591020346, 0.028652828186750412, -0.022418059408664703, -0.018907612189650536, -0.005696003325283527, -0.0298184584826231, 0.010436460375785828, 0.009264052845537663, 0.0027887034229934216, 0.011629198677837849, -0.0007217422244139016, 0.00513690710067749, 0.05093534663319588, -0.0002897134399972856, 0.011737629771232605, -0.01795884408056736, 0.005441868677735329, -0.005750218406319618, 0.008247514255344868, 0.01402822881937027, -0.021943673491477966, -0.0035714381374418736, 0.009711329825222492, -0.021496396511793137, -0.015492044389247894, -0.015342951752245426, 0.01542427483946085, -0.011574983596801758, -0.007969660684466362, -0.004028880503028631, -0.0261182580143